    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Edmondstown, Killucan, Co. Westmeath\r\nN91 W978\r\nSpacious 4-Bedroom Detached Bungalow on a Generous 0.64-Acre Site\r\n\r\nA wonderful opportunity to acquire a spacious detached bungalow extending to approximately 1,700 sq. ft., situated on a generous 0.64-acre site at Edmondstown, Killucan, Co. Westmeath.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 2005 under Planning No. 045289, this well-proportioned family home offers bright, spacious accommodation throughout and benefits from a west-facing garden, a spacious attic, and a highly convenient location approximately 100 yards from the local school and just 2 miles from Killucan.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, large open-plan kitchen/dining room, lounge, conservatory, utility room, guest WC, four bedrooms including a master bedroom with ensuite, and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nThe property is situated in the rural locality of Edmondstown, approximately 2 miles from Killucan, while benefiting from the convenience of being only approximately 100 yards from the local school. The surrounding area offers a pleasant countryside setting with access to the amenities and services of Killucan and the wider Westmeath area.\r\n\r\nViewing\r\nThis spacious bungalow, set on a substantial 0.64-acre site, offers excellent family accommodation in a peaceful countryside setting and is sure to appeal to those seeking a substantial home with generous outdoor space.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall – 4.88m x 1.77m\r\nWelcoming entrance hall with closet and timber flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room – 5.96m x 8.22m\r\nImpressive open-plan kitchen and dining area with fitted units and Stanley cooker, providing an excellent space for family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nLounge – 3.87m x 3.53m\r\nComfortable reception room featuring an open fireplace.\r\n\r\nConservatory – 4.00m x 3.20m\r\nBright additional living space with timber flooring and views towards the garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room – 3.23m x 1.97m\r\nFitted units and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nGuest WC – 1.58m x 1.00m\r\nWC and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom – 3.88m x 3.63m\r\nGenerously proportioned double bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nEnsuite – 2.77m x 1.77m\r\nFully tiled ensuite with WC, wash hand basin and shower.\r\n\r\nDouble Bedroom – 3.86m x 3.00m Carpeted.\r\n\r\nDouble Bedroom – 4.39m x 2.98m\r\nBright double bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nDouble Bedroom – 3.87m x 2.96m\r\nCarpeted double bedroom.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom – 3.38m x 2.37m\r\nFully tiled bathroom with WC, wash hand basin and bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Approx. 1,700 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nGenerous 0.64-acre site\r\n\r\nConstructed in 2005\r\n\r\nPlanning No. 045289\r\n\r\nWest-facing garden\r\n\r\nSpacious attic\r\n\r\nStanley cooker\r\n\r\nOpen fireplace\r\n\r\nConservatory\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\r\n\r\nCarpets, curtains and light shades included in the sale\r\n\r\nApproximately 100 yards from the local school\r\n\r\nApproximately 2 miles from Killucan\r\n\r\nFolio No. WH24158F\r\n\r\nBER: C – BER Certificate No. 119808343"
